アコン使用権を得るために指揮官の事を癒すことになるが…?CV:杠葉えりか","options":["SND","DLP","REV","TRI"],"url":"https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ300068.html","site_id":"home","fetched_at":1795535746}